{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">GET-INT64 function</span>\n","class":"manual","created":1470,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/309644","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/GET-INT64-function.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/GET-INT64-function.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"GET-INT64-function\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">GET-INT64 function</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"GET-INT64-function__section_N10024_N10021_N10001\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Returns the signed 64-bit value at the specified memory\nlocation as an INT64 value. </p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"GET-INT64-function__syntax_GC18NS2693766\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d148825e96\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"GET-INT64-function__idGDL2I72671182\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>GET-INT64 ( <var class=\"keyword varname\">source</var> , <var class=\"keyword varname\">position</var> )</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <dl class=\"dl parml\">\n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">source</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">A function or variable that returns a RAW or MEMPTR value. If <var class=\"keyword varname\">source</var> is\nthe Unknown value (<code class=\"ph codeph\">?</code>), GET-INT64 returns the Unknown value (<code class=\"ph codeph\">?</code>).</dd>\n        \n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">position</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">An integer value greater than 0 that indicates the byte position\nwhere you want to find the information. If <var class=\"keyword varname\">position</var> is greater\nthan the length of <var class=\"keyword varname\">source</var>, the AVM returns the Unknown value (<code class=\"ph codeph\">?</code>).\nIf <var class=\"keyword varname\">position</var> is less than 1, the AVM generates\na run-time error.</dd>\n        \n      </dl>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"GET-INT64-function__example_GC18NT2693782\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d148825e176\">Example</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">The\nfollowing example demonstrates how to get values in and out of RAW and\nMEMPTR values:</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <strong class=\"ph b\">r-getint64.p</strong>\n      </p>\n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"GET-INT64-function__idGDL2I92671189\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-1\">\n              <td class=\"entry break colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>DEFINE VARIABLE myint64  AS INT64   NO-UNDO INITIAL 7888999000.\nDEFINE VARIABLE myint    AS INTEGER NO-UNDO INITIAL 2345.\nDEFINE VARIABLE myraw    AS RAW     NO-UNDO.\nDEFINE VARIABLE result64 AS INT64   NO-UNDO.\nDEFINE VARIABLE result1  AS INTEGER NO-UNDO.\nDEFINE VARIABLE mymem    AS MEMPTR  NO-UNDO.\n\nASSIGN\n  PUT-LONG(myraw,1)  = myint\n  result1            = GET-LONG(myraw,1)\n  PUT-INT64(myraw,1) = myint64\n  result64           = GET-INT64(myraw,1).\n\nMESSAGE &quot;raw version &quot; result1 result64.\n\nASSIGN\n  result1            = ?\n  result64           = ?\n  SET-SIZE(mymem)    = 40\n  PUT-LONG(mymem,1)  = myint\n  result1            = GET-LONG(mymem,1)\n  PUT-INT64(mymem,1) = myint64\n  result64           = GET-INT64(mymem,1).\n\nMESSAGE &quot;memptr version &quot; result1 result64.\n\nresult1 = get-int64(mymem,1) NO-ERROR.\n\nMESSAGE &quot;store getint64 in int gives&quot; ERROR-STATUS:GET-MESSAGE(1).\nMESSAGE &quot;doing put-long of in64&quot; myint64.\n\nPUT-LONG(mymem,1) = myint64 NO-ERROR.\n\nMESSAGE &quot;storeint64 with put-long gives&quot; ERROR-STATUS:GET-MESSAGE(1). \nSET-SIZE(mymem) = 0.\n</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"GET-INT64-function__see-also_GC18NU2693787\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d148825e211\">See also</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"INT64-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/INT64-function.html\">INT64 function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"INTEGER-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/INTEGER-function.html\">INTEGER function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"PUT-INT64-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/PUT-INT64-statement.html\">PUT-INT64 statement</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"GET-LONG-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/GET-LONG-function.html\">GET-LONG function</a></p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"GET-FLOAT-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/GET-FLOAT-function.html\">GET-FLOAT function</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"GET-KEY-VALUE-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/GET-KEY-VALUE-statement.html\">GET-KEY-VALUE statement</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/309644","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":1318,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"GET-INT64 function","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/GET-INT64-function.html","type":"Manual"}